sentences.text:
This writ petition has been filed by the Petitioner seeking the following reliefs:-
"(i) Issue an appropriate writ, order or direction in the nature of a writ of mandamus and/or a suitable writ, order of direction against the respondents thereby directed the respondents to take punitive actions against the erring officials for not doing the investigation in fair and impartial manner;
(ii) Issue an appropriate writ, order or direction in the nature of a writ of mandamus and/or a suitable writ, order of direction against the respondents thereby directed the respondents to arrest the accused persons in the crime committed in F.I.R. No.286 OF 2021 under Sections 304B/498A/34 I.P.C., P.S. Gokalpuri, Delhi;
(iii) Issue an appropriate writ, order or direction in the nature of a writ of mandamus and/or a suitable writ, order of direction against the respondents thereby directed the respondents to change the investigating officer of the case to the senior officer or to handover the case to Crime Branch, so that entire investigation would be completed in a fair and impartial manner;
This is a digitally signed order.
Smt. Bimla Saini vs The State, Govt Of N.C.T. Of Delhi & Ors on 13 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/178583027/
